 her older brother. She always wants to be with him, and wants to help him with anything and everything. Naturally it's her duty as his little sister to serve as a model for his photography. In fact, she wants him to take pictures of her. She also wants to strongly show her feminine appeal to her older brother who has always thought of her as a child. She loves cooking. She still has a lot to learn when it comes to tennis."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76162"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e121c2d2b9cb398ca708637a44d07101b3f1ddacbdefb938ddfa14ab2016e80b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f6e22b779e6c865c33c79a7f8090d2db0b6c07fa69cd0941ee20729c06e9205.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花守 ゆみり","creatorId":"vndb:s14119","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14119","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14119","name":"花守 ゆみり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:79550","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76163","characterName":"日向寺 南夏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c76163"},"originalCharacterName":"日向寺 南夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"410"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist’s childhood friend who has always been in the same class with him since elementary school. She is easy to get along with and willing to talk about anything. She is a crude girl with a sharp tongue. She is always hungry and often eats. Her personality is as bright as the midsummer sun, and she is bad at keeping still. As a swimmer, her shortness bothers her. S